 "source": "Settings from listening tests of the authors' Foundation-1 examples (250-step variants, ConditioningZeroOut negative) for loops: 250 steps, CFG 7, dpmpp_3m_sde/exponential, length = bars*4*60/BPM (trim exact, latent +0.05 s); keybed = the authors' Foundation-1.2-Keybeds settings (80 steps, CFG 6, the author's sequence prompt, trim 19.25 s); AudioAdjustVolume -6 dB before the output; PreviewAudio = temp only. Foundation-1.2-Keybeds sounds one octave below the note name (pitch tracking with pyin: C4..F4 requested sound C3..F3, -1199 cents per note; the authors' own example the same; a synthetic control through the same code measures +1 cent), so the target writes every keybed note +12 semitones into the prompt (C4 -> C5, KEYBED_OCTAVE_OFFSET in music_gen/targets.py)",
